        <p>I started as a full-stack engineer in an Air Force R&amp;D unit, then spent years as an early engineer and architect at startups that grew fast and got acquired — Tonkean, then LayerX. Somewhere in there I learned I care as much about how a team works as what it ships.</p>
        <p>Then I built my own. Butler AI with a co-founder, Lumos AI on my own — more than a thousand customer conversations, real users, and two hard decisions to stop. That's most of what I bring to founders now: I've made these calls with my own money and time on the line.</p>
        <p>I also host Ambition Unlocked, a podcast about where ambition comes from and what it actually costs. I work from Israel, in Hebrew or English.</p>
